    <bpmn:process id="W_W4409" name="W4409. Lease Accounting Strategy, Policy &amp; PFRS 16/IFRS 16 Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PFRS 16 adoption; policy review; audit finding
Frequency: Annual + on standard/PFRS change
Volume: One enterprise lease-accounting policy/framework
Owner: Controller / Lease Accounting (VS-17) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), Tax (VS-79), Treasury (VS-18), Audit (VS-21), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), IT/EA (VS-27/VS-113)
Source: workflow W4409 — Lease Accounting Strategy, Policy &amp; PFRS 16/IFRS 16 Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4409_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4409_Lane1" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4409_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4409_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4409_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4409_Lane2" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4409_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4409_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4409_Start4" name="PFRS 16 adoption; policy review; audit finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4409_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4409_Task5" name="Controller/Lease Accounting set the PFRS 16 accounting policy — scope…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Controller/Lease Accounting set the PFRS 16 accounting policy — scope, recognition/exemption elections (short-term, low-value), discount-rate methodology (incremental borrowing rate vs implicit), lease-term (incl. renewal options reasonably certain), and component separation (lease vs non-lease vs service)
Responsible (R): Controller / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): CFO / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4409_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4409_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4409_Task6" name="Controller/Audit document judgments &amp; estimates (discount rate, term, variable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Controller/Audit document judgments &amp; estimates (discount rate, term, variable payments, restoration), align with external auditor, and embed in the accounting manual
Responsible (R): Controller / Audit / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4409_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4409_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4409_Task7" name="Lease Accounting/EA/IT translate policy into the lease-accounting system config…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting/EA/IT translate policy into the lease-accounting system config (W4427), controls (W4428), and disclosure templates (W4425)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / EA / IT
Accountable (A): Controller / CIO
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4409_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4409_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4409_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4409_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4409_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-674 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Portfolio Identification, Recognition &amp; PFRS 16 Transition (PA-148.1).) | - CTL-674: group PFRS 16 policy; elections documented &amp; auditor-aligned; judgments supported; reviewed annually (W4428)
Owner: Controller / Lease Accounting (VS-17) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4409_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4409_Annotation9" targetRef="W4409_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4409_Flow11" sourceRef="W4409_Start4" targetRef="W4409_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4409_Flow12" sourceRef="W4409_Task5" targetRef="W4409_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4409_Flow13" sourceRef="W4409_Task6" targetRef="W4409_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4409_Flow14" sourceRef="W4409_Task7" targetRef="W4409_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
