    <bpmn:process id="W_W4410" name="W4410. Lease Portfolio Discovery, Identification &amp; Lease-Component Extraction" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Initial adoption; new contract; periodic refresh
Frequency: Continuous (per contract) + annual portfolio sweep
Volume: ~205 real-estate + equipment/fleet/IT leases across 5 entities
Owner: Lease Accounting / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20) / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34)
Participants: Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Procurement (VS-03/VS-34), Treasury (VS-18), IT (VS-99), Fleet (VS-06/VS-61), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W4410 — Lease Portfolio Discovery, Identification &amp; Lease-Component Extraction</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4410_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4410_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4410_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4410_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4410_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4410_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4410_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4410_Start3" name="Initial adoption; new contract; periodic refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4410_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4410_Task4" name="Lease Accounting coordinate a portfolio sweep — real-estate (VS-97/VS-20)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting coordinate a portfolio sweep — real-estate (VS-97/VS-20), equipment/forklifts (VS-138), fleet (VS-06/VS-61), IT/POS hardware (VS-99), fixtures — to identify every contract containing a lease (or embedded lease)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / RE / Procurement / IT / Fleet
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4410_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4410_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4410_Task5" name="Lease Accounting/Legal determine whether each arrangement *contains a lease*…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting/Legal determine whether each arrangement *contains a lease* (identified asset + right-to-direct-use + obtain-substantially-all-economic-benefits test), separating lease from service/non-lease components
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Legal
Accountable (A): Controller / VP Legal
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4410_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4410_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4410_Task6" name="Lease Accounting register identified leases in the lease-accounting repository…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting register identified leases in the lease-accounting repository (W4426), assign unique IDs, owner, entity, and link to the contract record (VS-29)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4410_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4410_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4410_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4410_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4410_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-674 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Portfolio Identification, Recognition &amp; PFRS 16 Transition (PA-148.1).) | - CTL-674: portfolio sweep covers all lease types; lease-identification test applied; embedded leases extracted; registered in repository (W4426)
Owner: Lease Accounting / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20) / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4410_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4410_Annotation8" targetRef="W4410_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
