    <bpmn:process id="W_W4412" name="W4412. Discount Rate, Lease Term &amp; Payment Determination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New lease (W4411); remeasurement trigger (W4418)
Frequency: Per lease + on remeasurement
Volume: All recognized leases
Owner: Lease Accounting / Treasury (VS-18)
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17.4), Audit (VS-21), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20)
Source: workflow W4412 — Discount Rate, Lease Term &amp; Payment Determination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4412_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4412_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4412_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4412_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4412_Lane2" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4412_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4412_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4412_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4412_Start4" name="New lease (W4411); remeasurement trigger (W4418)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4412_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4412_Task5" name="Treasury/Lease Accounting determine the discount rate — lessee&#x27;s incremental…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/Lease Accounting determine the discount rate — lessee&#x27;s incremental borrowing rate (IBR) by currency/term/entity (or implicit rate if readily determinable), using a documented methodology &amp; market data
Responsible (R): Treasury / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Treasurer / Controller
Duration: Per lease + periodic refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4412_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4412_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4412_Task6" name="Lease Accounting determine the lease term — non-cancellable period + periods…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting determine the lease term — non-cancellable period + periods covered by options reasonably certain to be exercised (renewal) / not to be exercised (termination), with documented assessment
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4412_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4412_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4412_Task7" name="Lease Accounting determine lease payments — fixed + escalation +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting determine lease payments — fixed + escalation + variable-based-on-index/rate + exercise-purchase-option-if-reasonably-certain + penalties-for-termination + MAKE-GOOD, excluding variable-based-on-performance/usage
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Treasury
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4412_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4412_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
