      <bpmn:userTask id="W4414_Task4" name="lease liability">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting calculate the lease liability at present value of unpaid lease payments (discounted per W4412) over the lease term (W4412)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4414_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4414_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4414_Task5" name="ROU asset">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting calculate the ROU asset = liability + initial direct costs + estimated restoration/MAKE-GOOD − lease incentives received + prepayments, and post the journal (DR ROU asset / CR liability)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Controller
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4414_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4414_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4414_Task6" name="Lease Accounting post the commencement journal to GL (VS-17), assign…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting post the commencement journal to GL (VS-17), assign asset/sub-asset to the fixed-asset register (links VS-35), and evidence review
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Controller
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4414_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4414_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
