        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Controller/Lease Accounting select &amp; document the transition method — modified retrospective (cumulative adjustment to opening retained earnings, no restatement) vs full retrospective — per policy (W4409) and auditor guidance
Responsible (R): Controller / Lease Accounting / External Auditor
Accountable (A): CFO / Audit Committee
Duration: Per adoption</bpmn:documentation>
