    <bpmn:process id="W_W4416" name="W4416. Multi-Entity (5 Entities) Consolidated Lease Accounting Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New entity (VS-130); reorganization; system setup
Frequency: Per setup + on structural change
Volume: 5-entity group (Holdings, Depot, Logistics, Digital Commerce, Property Mgmt)
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Consolidation (VS-17)
Participants: Controller, Consolidation (VS-17), Intercompany (VS-72), Treasury (VS-18), IT/EA (VS-27/VS-113), Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4416 — Multi-Entity (5 Entities) Consolidated Lease Accounting Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4416_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4416_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4416_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4416_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4416_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4416_Lane2" name="Consolidation">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4416_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4416_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4416_Start4" name="New entity (VS-130); reorganization; system setup">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4416_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4416_Task5" name="Lease Accounting/Consolidation configure per-entity lease accounting…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/Consolidation configure per-entity lease accounting (entity-specific IBR, COA, currency PHP, fiscal cal) and the intercompany-lease map (e.g. Property Mgmt as lessor to Depot, links VS-97/VS-72)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Consolidation / IT
Accountable (A): Controller / CIO
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4416_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4416_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4416_Task6" name="Lease Accounting/Intercompany identify intercompany leases (lessor &amp; lessee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting/Intercompany identify intercompany leases (lessor &amp; lessee within group), and set up the consolidation-elimination rules (W4424)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Intercompany / Consolidation
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4416_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4416_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4416_Task7" name="Consolidation/Lease Accounting validate the consolidated ROU/liability, run…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Consolidation/Lease Accounting validate the consolidated ROU/liability, run eliminations (W4424), and reconcile to the group FS (VS-17)
Responsible (R): Consolidation / Lease Accounting / Audit
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4416_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4416_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4416_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4416_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4416_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-674 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Portfolio Identification, Recognition &amp; PFRS 16 Transition (PA-148.1).) | - CTL-674: per-entity config per group standard; intercompany-lease map maintained; eliminations validated (W4424); reconciled to group FS
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Consolidation (VS-17)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4416_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4416_Annotation9" targetRef="W4416_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4416_Flow11" sourceRef="W4416_Start4" targetRef="W4416_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4416_Flow12" sourceRef="W4416_Task5" targetRef="W4416_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4416_Flow13" sourceRef="W4416_Task6" targetRef="W4416_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4416_Flow14" sourceRef="W4416_Task7" targetRef="W4416_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
